<style>
/* K · Cormorant Garamond with Jost. Announcement bar, one-row header. Menus: capital text columns with a photograph flush right. Two buttons under the intro. */
:root{--display:"Cormorant Garamond",Georgia,serif;--sans:"Jost",system-ui,sans-serif}
.logo{font-size:32px;font-weight:600}
.nav{margin-left:clamp(36px,4vw,64px);gap:clamp(18px,2vw,30px)}
.hero-copy h1{font:600 clamp(38px,3.8vw,60px)/1.02 var(--display)}
.hide-d{display:none}
@media (max-width:1080px){.hide-d{display:inline-flex}}
.sp + .ws{padding-top:0}
.sp:has(+ .ws){padding-bottom:clamp(40px,4vw,56px)}
.bh + .sp-size{padding-top:0}
.sp-size + .pv-k{padding-top:0}
.sp-size:has(+ .pv-k){padding-bottom:clamp(40px,4vw,56px)}
.pv-k + .rv{padding-top:clamp(40px,4vw,56px)}
.pv-k + .bd2{padding-top:0}
.bd2 + .rv{padding-top:0}
.rv.r1 .cards{align-items:stretch}
.rv.r1 .cd{border-top:0;padding-top:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100%}
.rv.r1 .cd .rq{flex:1}
/* one rhythm: every section below the hero sits the same distance apart */
:root{--sec:clamp(56px,6vw,88px)}
main > section:not(.hero):not(.next){padding-top:0!important;padding-bottom:0!important;margin-top:var(--sec)!important;margin-bottom:0!important}
main > section.next{margin-top:var(--sec)}
</style>

<div class="sy syv6"><section class="sy6-hero"><div class="sy-ph sy6-bg">{%- render 'ah-vid', f: 'story-hero.mp4' -%}<span>Film or photo, full width</span></div><div class="sy6-t"><span class="sy-k" data-rv>Our story</span><h1 class="sy-split">Axel &amp; Hound</h1><p data-rv>Beautiful things for dogs, and the homes they share.</p></div></section><section class="sy5-slide"><p class="sy5-a">Beautifully made.</p><p class="sy5-b">Or practical.</p><p class="sy5-c" data-rv>We wanted both, so we went looking.</p></section><section class="sy5-origin"><p data-rv>It started with two dogs and a long search.</p><p data-rv>Biscuit, a miniature dachshund with a very long back. Juno, a whippet who shivers at the first sign of autumn.</p><p data-rv>Everything we found for them was either beautifully made or practical. Almost never both.</p><p data-rv>So we went looking for the people who could do both.</p></section><section class="sy5-run"><div class="sy5-rs"><span class="sy-k">What we collect</span><div class="sy5-track"><div class="sy5-item"><div class="sy-ph ">{%- render 'ah-img', f: 'story-collect-beds.jpg', cls: 'sy-fill' -%}<span>Photo, 1:1</span></div><b>Beds</b><span>Deep, soft and made to be washed, because they will be.</span></div><div class="sy5-item"><div class="sy-ph ">{%- render 'ah-img', f: 'story-collect-coats.jpg', cls: 'sy-fill' -%}<span>Photo, 1:1</span></div><b>Coats</b><span>Cut for real shapes: long backs, deep chests, narrow waists.</span></div><div class="sy5-item"><div class="sy-ph ">{%- render 'ah-img', f: 'story-collect-walking.jpg', cls: 'sy-fill' -%}<span>Photo, 1:1</span></div><b>Walking</b><span>Leather, rope and waxed cotton that soften with every walk.</span></div><div class="sy5-item"><div class="sy-ph ">{%- render 'ah-img', f: 'story-collect-dining.jpg', cls: 'sy-fill' -%}<span>Photo, 1:1</span></div><b>Dining</b><span>Stoneware and oak that belong on a kitchen floor.</span></div><div class="sy5-item"><div class="sy-ph ">{%- render 'ah-img', f: 'story-collect-play.jpg', cls: 'sy-fill' -%}<span>Photo, 1:1</span></div><b>Play</b><span>Wool felt and natural rubber, sturdy enough to last.</span></div><div class="sy5-item"><div class="sy-ph ">{%- render 'ah-img', f: 'story-collect-travel.jpg', cls: 'sy-fill' -%}<span>Photo, 1:1</span></div><b>Travel</b><span>Carriers and beds for weekends away and long drives home.</span></div></div></div></section><section class="sy2-route" style="--n:6"><div class="sy2-stage"><div class="sy2-hd"><span class="sy-k">Made by Europe&rsquo;s best</span><h2>Across Europe</h2></div><div class="sy2-line"><div class="sy2-draw"></div><i style="left:8.0%"><b>Germany</b></i><i style="left:24.8%"><b>Denmark</b></i><i style="left:41.6%"><b>Italy</b></i><i style="left:58.4%"><b>France</b></i><i style="left:75.2%"><b>Netherlands</b></i><i style="left:92.0%"><b>Scotland</b></i></div><div class="sy2-stops"><div class="sy2-stop"><span class="sy2-c">Germany</span><h3>Cloud7</h3><p>Coats and beds from a Berlin studio that has dressed city dogs for twenty years.</p></div><div class="sy2-stop"><span class="sy2-c">Denmark</span><h3>Hollow &amp; Hearth</h3><p>Wool blankets and bedding woven on the coast north of Copenhagen.</p></div><div class="sy2-stop"><span class="sy2-c">Italy</span><h3>Clay &amp; Kiln</h3><p>Stoneware bowls thrown and glazed by hand outside Milan.</p></div><div class="sy2-stop"><span class="sy2-c">France</span><h3>Maison Lune</h3><p>Bouclé and linen beds stitched in a small atelier in Lyon.</p></div><div class="sy2-stop"><span class="sy2-c">Netherlands</span><h3>Fold &amp; Field</h3><p>Waxed cotton coats and leads from a workshop in Utrecht.</p></div><div class="sy2-stop"><span class="sy2-c">Scotland</span><h3>Bridle &amp; Co</h3><p>Bridle leather collars cut and stitched in the Scottish borders.</p></div></div><div class="sy-ph sy2-ph">{%- render 'ah-img', f: 'story-workshops.jpg', cls: 'sy-fill' -%}<span>Photo, 3:2, at each workshop</span></div></div></section><section class="sy-rules"><div data-rv><h3>Made to last</h3><p>If it won&rsquo;t survive a muddy winter, it doesn&rsquo;t make the cut.</p></div><div data-rv><h3>Made well</h3><p>Proper seams, honest materials, nothing that frays by spring.</p></div><div data-rv><h3>Made beautifully</h3><p>Something you&rsquo;re happy to leave out in the living room.</p></div><div data-rv><h3>Lived with first</h3><p>Every piece spends weeks at home with our own dogs before it reaches you.</p></div></section><section class="sy-close"><div class="sy-ph sy-wipe sy-cph">{%- render 'ah-vid', f: 'story-close.mp4' -%}<span>Film, 16:9</span></div><h2 class="sy-split">Still small, on purpose.</h2><p data-rv>We pack every order by hand, wrap it in tissue and answer every email ourselves. Thank you for being part of it.</p><p class="sy-sig">Sam &amp; Alex</p><div class="sy-cta"><a class="sy-btn" href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/new-in">Shop new in</a><a class="sy-btn sy-o" href="/pages/brands">Meet the makers</a></div></section></div>


